                            <section class=3D"product-description-section">
                    <div class=3D"description-card">
                        <h2 class=3D"description-title">Product Details</h2=
>
                        <div class=3D"rich-text-content">
                            <h2>Buy Demo Used Leica Absolute AT960 SR Laser=
 Tracker bundle with controller, T-probe III, Ready to go and calibrated by=
 Leica authorized, 12 month Leica extension warranty.</h2>

<p>The Leica Absolute Tracker AT960-SR (Short Range) is a high-precision, p=
ortable laser tracker designed for high-end metrology applications that req=
uire high accuracy within a smaller workspace. It is the entry-level model =
in the AT960 series, optimized for users who don't need the extensive range=
 of the MR, LR, or XR variants but still require 6 Degrees of Freedom (6DoF=
) functionality.</p>

<p><strong>Leica Absolute AT960 SR Laser Tracker Includes:</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>Leica AT960-SR Absolute Tracker Scanner</li>
	<li>Controller</li>
	<li>T-probe III</li>
	<li>Sensor cable</li>
	<li>AT quick release mount</li>
	<li>External temperature sensor</li>
	<li>Red ring reflector</li>
	<li>Reference sphere</li>
	<li>Cleaning kit</li>
	<li>Protective sensor cover</li>
	<li>User Manual</li>
	<li>Carbon Tripod by Hexagon w/ cover bag</li>
	<li>2X Hard Case</li>
	<li>1-Year Hexagon warranty</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Core Specifications</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>Measurement Volume (3D): Up to 12 meters.</li>
	<li>Measurement Volume (6DoF): Up to 10 meters in diameter.</li>
	<li>Accuracy (Reflector): \(\pm 15 \mu m + 6 \mu m/m\) (Maximum Permissibl=
e Error).</li>
	<li>Data Rate: Real-time output up to 1,000 points per second.</li>
	<li>Portability: Weights less than 14 kg (tracker unit only).</li>
	<li>Environmental Protection: IP54 rated for protection against dust and w=
ater ingress in harsh industrial environments.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Key Features</strong></p>

<p>All-in-One Design: Integrates all necessary equipment for 6DoF probing, =
scanning, and reflector measurement into a single unit that fits in one fli=
ght case.<br>
Absolute Interferometer (AIFM): Combines the high speed of an interferomete=
r with the accuracy of an absolute distance meter, allowing for rapid measu=
rement of moving targets without a "home point".<br>
PowerLock Technology: Automatically re-establishes an interrupted laser bea=
m within a wide field of view without user intervention.<br>
Battery &amp; Wi-Fi: Supports hot-swappable battery operation and built-in =
Wi-Fi for completely wireless, cable-free operation.<br>
6DoF Compatibility: Fully compatible with accessories like the Leica T-Prob=
e, Leica T-Scan 5, and the Absolute Scanner AS1 for probing hidden points a=
nd high-speed surface scanning.</p>

<ul>
</ul>

<p>The Leica Absolute Tracker AT960 is a robust, all-in-one laser tracker t=
hat fits in a single flight case. Offering high-speed dynamic measurement a=
s standard, it is a complete solution for six degrees of freedom (6DoF) pro=
bing, scanning and automated inspection as well as reflector measurement.</=
p>

<p>A new generation of portable CMM system based on proven technology, the =
AT960 brings together the 6DoF functionality introduced with the Leica Abso=
lute Tracker AT901 and the portability and usability delivered by the compa=
ct Leica Absolute Tracker AT403. The result is a highly-sophisticated yet e=
asy-to-use large-volume measurement solution weighing less than 14 kilogram=
s.</p>

<p>The AT960 laser tracker can be transported easily, unpacked quickly and =
powered up in minutes to deliver high-performance measurement almost anywhe=
re. Dynamic features and flexible functionality give users absolute speed, =
accuracy and portability.</p>

<p><strong>All-in-one design</strong><br>
With all the equipment for measurement to a reflector, Leica T-Probe, Leica=
 T-Scan or Leica T-Mac built in, the compact all-in-one unit is ultra-porta=
ble for easy transportation to measure anywhere.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>PowerLock</strong><br>
Interrupted line of sight is automatically re-established in a +/-5 degree =
field of view with no user interaction required for ease of use and excepti=
onal performance in even the most crowded measurement volume</p>

<p><strong>Battery power</strong><br>
Independent hot-swap battery power supply allows a quick and easy cable-fre=
e setup in almost any location for better portability, offering a flexible =
solution that lasts up to a day=E2=80=99s shift =E2=80=93 wherever the trac=
ker is needed.</p>

<p><strong>Wi-Fi</strong><br>
Built-in Wi-Fi enables simple setup and communication with the PC for truly=
 wireless operations, also providing remote control options via laptops, ta=
blets or smartphones so the tracker can be operated by a single user.</p>

<p><strong>IP54</strong><br>
The IEC-certified sealed unit guarantees ingress protection against dust an=
d other contaminants, enabling the tracker to measure effectively in even t=
he harshest environments.</p>

<p><strong>MeteoStation</strong><br>
Integrated environmental unit monitors conditions including temperature, pr=
essure and humidity to compensate for changes and ensure accurate measureme=
nts regardless of external factors.</p>

<p><strong>Overview camera (OVC)</strong><br>
High-resolution colour OVC enables operators to remotely view the tracker=
=E2=80=99s field of vision, locating targets to measure to fixed reflectors=
 =E2=80=93 including multi-spot handling in a single image =E2=80=93 ideal =
for static hidden point devices or to supplement documentation.</p>

<p><strong>Orient to gravity (OTG)</strong><br>
The OTG function enables users to measure with the Z-axis aligned to gravit=
y, ideal for levelling and alignment tasks such as build and inspect of too=
l and jig fixturing.</p>

<p><strong>Absolute Interferometer</strong><br>
The Absolute Interferometer (AIFM) single distancing unit combines the accu=
racy of an absolute distance meter and the speed of an interferometer to gi=
ve readings quickly and accurately with no need for a home point.</p>

<p><strong>1 kHz data output</strong><br>
Real-time architecture with dynamic performance gives a measurement rate of=
 up to 1 000 points per second, enabling more detailed data capture, more q=
uickly.</p>

<p><strong>Real-Time Feature Pack</strong><br>
Enhance the AT960 with 7DoF data collection to enable the possibilities of =
real-time machine guidance.</p>

<p><strong>&nbsp;Integrated mini variozoom</strong><br>
With a constant field of view in any light conditions, mini variozoom provi=
des 6DoF measurement capabilities for accurate probing, scanning and machin=
e control applications.</p>

<p><strong>&nbsp;Real-Time Asset Management</strong><br>
The AT960/AT930/ATS600 is fully compatible with HxGN SFx | Asset Management=
, the leading solution for asset performance management in the world of Ind=
ustry 4.0. Based on data collected in real-time and reported through a cent=
ralised user-friendly dashboard, SFx Asset Management has been optimised fo=
r the management of laser tracker-based systems and is an essential part of=
 every smart manufacturing strategy.</p>                        </div>
